    "body": "**Hands-on GUI check passed** (contributor, macOS, fresh build of this head, which includes main's #383 machine-file editor):\n- Machines pane → Tormach 770MX → **Use for this setup**: the status line reads \"machine: built-in: Tormach 770MX\", the browser's Machine row shows Tormach 770MX, and the button greys out with \"Cannot assign: it is already this setup's machine\".\n- Lathe → **Use for this setup**: \"machine: built-in: Lathe\", the Machine row shows TURNING CENTER 2-AXIS, and the **ribbon switches to the turning families** (Turning…/Drilling…/Turning…).\n- **Undo** returns the setup to \"no machine\" with the button enabled again.\n\nThe command path was also checked headlessly on `test-426.camproj` (UseCatalogueMachine → kind Lathe, status as above). Ready for review.",
